note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Concatenate the repaired function-mode encoder and checked spec unchanged before this adapter.
note One instruction representation; emit only words returned by the checked sp_enc.
fn bc_encode ins view ulong 8192 phys view ulong 288 n ulong pad ulong code edit uchar 16384 to ulong
state = new ulong 3001 0
o = new ulong 16 0
w = new ulong 4 0
if or eq n 0 gt n 1024
ret 0
end
cnt = n
if ne pad 0
cnt = mul div add n 7 8 8
if lt cnt 32
cnt = 32
end
end
for i ulong n
opnds ins i phys o
if ne sp_enc state o w 0
ret 0
end
store code i w
end
if gt cnt n
note BW_IR_NOP is opcode0; padding is encoded semantically, never pasted machine bytes.
for j ulong 16
put o j 0
end
if ne sp_enc state o w 0
ret 0
end
for j ulong sub cnt n
store code add n j w
end
end
ret mul cnt 16
end
